ce": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the latest deploy of v2.3.1 (error rate 18% across us-east, us-west, eu-west). v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1 were both marked unhealthy. Rolled back all production regions to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release. Post-rollback: service healthy, error rate 0.2% in all regions. Follow-up: investigate root cause in v2.3.1 before redeploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "confidence": 0.93}, "confidence": 0.93}, {"t_ms": 51986, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01GM1Z18A8m596CCae9ZgMki", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["reconcile_lookup", "reconciled_executed", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 51986, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01GM1Z18A8m596CCae9ZgMki", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 55375, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Version chosen:** v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release. The two releases after it, v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1, were both marked unhealthy.\n- **Before the rollback:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate.\n- **After the rollback:** all three regions are on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback and the current state. As a follow-up, it says to find the root cause in v2.3.1 before deploying it again.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01ShP4TJkXevFqZ4GYjc13yp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "c