_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Version chosen:** v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release. The two releases after it, v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1, were both marked unhealthy.\n- **Before the rollback:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate.\n- **After the rollback:** all three regions are on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback and the current state. As a follow-up, it says to find the root cause in v2.3.1 before deploying it again.", "type": "text"}]}]}